<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "環境音\chilly_hell.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "WAIT"}
{PLAYMOVIE "光2.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "0" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n255\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n255\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>Lately, I keep having a strange dream.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Since I don't know when, someone has slipped inside me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That person gets in my way.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No matter what... I want to know.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My operation isn't over yet.<PG>
With the truth still in the dark, the curse-killings met their <STYLE ID="1" RUBY="しゅうえん">demise</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There shouldn't be any more curse-killings.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But―<PG>
Inside me, two opposing voices ring out.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A warning: 'Do not seek the truth.'
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A revelation: 'The truth lies there.'
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Two people have slipped inside me.<PG>
Unfortunately, though, they have no language.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So I can't tell what they're trying to say.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Only the voices: 'Do not seek the truth.' 'The truth lies there.'
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This much, I could understand.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Why would they say such things―<PG>
The one thing that's certain is that since then, I've piled deduction on deduction and come to where I can almost reach the truth.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What I could be sure of―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Kotaro-san</STYLE> is not the culprit.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But to prove it, a delusion far, far too big would have to be fact.<PG>
And that delusion gets erased the moment I wake from the dream.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
One of the people inside me erases that delusion.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Telling me: do not seek the truth―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even right now, that delusion is in the middle of being erased.<PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯着信1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "900" "0"}
Right now, I'm inside the dream.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The finished delusion that goes by the name of deduction crumbles away.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Wait. I'm this close to reaching the truth.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even if I learn the truth, I won't tell anyone―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The culprit behind the curse-killings can't be anyone but that person.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Because that's how it is, isn't it?<PG>
In a few seconds, I'll wake up.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'll wander into the maze called reality.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And I'll forget everything.<PG>
Yes, this is because <STYLE ID="3">Niimura-senpai's mother</STYLE> stopped my pursuit of the truth―
{PAUSE ""}
a brake imprinted on my heart.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I must not know the truth.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A delusion that goes by the name of deduction, allowed only inside dreams.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That's all for today.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Today, again, the operation has failed.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\車走行中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "WAIT"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\ワゴン後部座席昼.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\桃子横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I felt some kind of vibration and woke up.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When I looked beside me, <STYLE ID="4">Sis</STYLE> was gazing outside with a sullen face.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Sis</STYLE> taking part in a family outing. Rare things do happen.<PG>
"<STYLE ID="4">Momoko</STYLE>, you're off from your part-time job tomorrow too, right? You can take it easy, can't you?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Whatever..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Sis's</STYLE> attitude was the same as ever.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">Sis</STYLE> used to be kind, but at some point she started behaving badly, and she even dropped out of high school.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
These days, I hardly know what kind of life she leads outside the house.<PG>
Come to think of it, I had a feeling my phone had rung a little while ago.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ黄ストラップ入.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "B" "100" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―It seemed there'd been a call from <STYLE ID="5">Niimura-senpai</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> was on a trip with the Kogori family.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If she was calling me, she was probably feeling awkward after all.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I should call her back right away.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\電話呼び出し.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "4000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "0" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"Hiii! It's </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">your</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> Goto-chan!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I was still sleepy, but I greeted her in a high-energy voice.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Oh, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">. You at the amusement park yet?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">―</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Niimura-senpai</STYLE>, from what I heard, was feeling awkward with the Kogori family after all.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When I told <STYLE ID="5">Senpai</STYLE> the things she seemed to be losing sight of, she accepted them easily enough.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ黄ストラップ切.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "200" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">... do you always talk down to your </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> like that?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"I'm not talking down to her or anything..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"I don't know what you two are to each other, but you don't talk to a senpai like that."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
After that, she shut her mouth.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Sis</STYLE> and I just can't get along, no matter what.<PG>
<STYLE ID="8">Kana-chan</STYLE> said it at the secret base in Arata.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That <STYLE ID="4">Sis</STYLE> and I were just a little out of step.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That it wasn't <STYLE ID="4">Sis</STYLE> avoiding me, but me avoiding <STYLE ID="4">Sis</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When she treats me like this, my resolve breaks.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
―While all that was going on, we reached our destination.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\日々と泉.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\遊園地1.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\遊園地2.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\遊園地3.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\桃子バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Amazing..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Faced with the biggest amusement park in Japan, even <STYLE ID="4">Sis</STYLE> let out a sound of admiration.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Let's drop our bags off at the hotel first."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Okay!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
With Dad leading the way, we dropped our bags off at the hotel and went straight into the park.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\walking_on_night_streets.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "5000" "WAIT"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\遊園地人ごみ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
As expected, the crowds were huge.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I let my guard down even a little, I'd probably get separated from my family.<PG>
Come to think of it, I'd promised <STYLE ID="5">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> a video call.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ黄ストラップ切.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ黄ストラップ入.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "200" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\電話呼び出し.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "4000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "0" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
On the screen were my <STYLE ID="5">senpai</STYLE>, lined up side by side on what looked like a beach.<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Hiii, you two! Enjoying your time with just the family?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Hey! You made it to the amusement park?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　Actually, that's some noise... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">Is the amusement park crowded after all?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"It's amazing! Here, take a look!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">　All these people, people, people!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I tried to get the rides behind me on camera, but at my height it was pretty hard...<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> are way too short. There's nothing on screen but people. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">C'mon, forget the people, show us the rides or something."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"I'm stretching my arm out as far as it'll go here!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{QUAKE "000,メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="6">　Mmph-mph... can't breathe..."</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Tossed around by the waves of people, I couldn't even stand still anymore―<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"All the rides are... </STYLE>
{QUAKE "000,メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "500" "30"}
<STYLE ID="6">mmph, like hours-long waits... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Huh? Dad and the others are gone... </STYLE>
{QUAKE "000,メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "500" "30"}
<STYLE ID="6">Squeeeze!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,アイテム1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
All around me was nothing but walls of people.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'd been careful, but I got separated from my family anyway.<PG>
{STOPSND "SE" "0" "PASS"}
Then, 
{PAUSE ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\布団.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
someone gave my hand a sharp tug.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The hand didn't feel like Dad's or Mom's.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\遊園地3.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\桃子バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">You're the smallest shorty in the whole Goto clan, so watch yourself."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\誰もいない校舎で.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
The one who pulled me out was <STYLE ID="4">Sis</STYLE>.<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Sorry..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"At times like that, it's not 'sorry,' it's 'thank you,' right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">Sis</STYLE> quickly stepped away from me.<PG>
Dad and the others were right nearby.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At some point, I'd apparently hung up the call.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\遊園地1.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The popular rides all had waits of several hours, so we could only pick a few we wanted to ride.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Mom and Dad said they'd go along with whatever I wanted to ride.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Sis</STYLE> was standing a ways off from us, but she wouldn't meet our eyes.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\遊園地3.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\桃子横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, thanks for helping me earlier."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, which one do you want to ride?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Any of them's fine."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Come on, just pick one at least. Today I'll even do my best to try a roller coaster."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\紙ペラ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
I spread the park map open in front of <STYLE ID="4">Sis's</STYLE> face.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"This one, then."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Sis</STYLE> pointed at random without even looking at the map.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Huh...? This one?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Ugh, I said this one, didn't I?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What her finger pointed to was...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\遊園地お化け屋敷入口.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
