{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"M-Mom and I will wait here, so you two go on in!
{PAUSE ""}
　Oh, Mom, let's have a beer or something!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"H-ho-ho-ho! Let's do that, Dad!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"What!? You're kidding, right!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">　Wai..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\桃子バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"............"</STYLE><PG>
In front of the attraction <STYLE ID="4">Sis</STYLE> had pointed at, the two of us were left behind on our own.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Only this one had a strangely short line.<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">... why'd you pick this one?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"I-it couldn't be helped! I wasn't looking at the map!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This was <STYLE ID="4">Sis</STYLE> snapping back at me when she was the one in the wrong... or rather, she was rattled.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No wonder. We were about to go into this attraction.<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"S-</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">... don't you ever leave my side!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">You're</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> in high school already, aren't you!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">　Wh-wh-what are you so scared of! What happened to your operation!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"The operation... failed the moment we picked this place..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This place was so high-quality―
{PAUSE ""}
in other words, the line was apparently short because it was too scary.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\恐怖BGM2.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "700" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Fearfully, we stepped into the haunted house.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">There were no cars to ride. It was the kind you walk through on your own feet.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"It's pitch-black..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"O-o-of course it is! There's no such thing as a bright haunted house!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
We hadn't gone even a meter in, and I couldn't even see <STYLE ID="4">Sis's</STYLE> face, though she had to be right next to me.<PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\swish.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
I grabbed <STYLE ID="4">Sis's</STYLE> sleeve.<PG>
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="9"><TXSPS>"Aaaagh"</STYLE><BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"Eeeeek"</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4"><TXSPN>Sis's</STYLE> scream made me cry out too before I could stop myself.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Why'd you suddenly yank my sleeve!? Don't scare me like that!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Buuut..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> nearly died at that funeral the other day, didn't you!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">　Something like this is nothing, right!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"It wasn't a funeral, it was the thirteenth-year memorial service..." [TN: Buddhist memorials count the year of death as the first year.]</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Trembling, we shuffled forward.<PG>
Even if someone tells me to go to a haunted spot, I don't find it especially scary.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Because there can't be anything unscientific in this world.<PG>
Haunted houses, on the other hand, I really can't handle.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Because in a haunted house, things are guaranteed to 'show up.'
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'm fully aware that whatever shows up is fake.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And they're fully aware that we walk into a haunted house thinking exactly that.<PG>
That's exactly why they calculate, down to the last detail, how to scare us.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That's exactly why, however much of a genius girl I am, taking on an operation drawn up by professionals in the field is far too reckless.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That's exactly why... it's so scary...<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">... what's that?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When we'd finally made it 3 meters from the entrance, I pointed ahead, hiding behind <STYLE ID="4">Sis</STYLE>.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Huh!? There's nothing there!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"No, but just now..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When I looked again... 
{PAUSE ""}
there really was nothing.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> call yourself a genius girl, don't you? Get a grip!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Genius has nothing to do with it..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "SE" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\雑魚.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\五島携帯霊2.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "540" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MOTION "789" "人物1" "4" "0" "200" "DEC" "WAIT"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{WAIT "200" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
