{MESON "500"}
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="11"><TXSPS>"Aaaaaaagh!!!!"</STYLE><BR>
<STYLE ID="12">"Aaaaaaagh!!!!"</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<TXSPN>At the ghost that suddenly appeared, we let out screams like never before.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\down1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
My knees had no strength left at all, and my legs gave out under me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\アスファルトダッシュ.ogg" "SE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
At the same time, footsteps echoed, moving away from me.<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"S-S-</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">　Wait for me!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My legs were shaking so much I couldn't stand up properly.<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Waaah! Don't leave me behind..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was so scary that I finally burst into tears.<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, you... big idiooot! Waaah!"</STYLE><PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "SE" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\布団.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
Then someone appeared and tugged at my hand.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\桃子バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"I've been right here the whole time, though?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">　The one that ran off just now was the ghost."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Uuugh, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Siiiis</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I couldn't think about anything anymore, and I clung tight to <STYLE ID="4">Sis</STYLE>.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
In the end, <STYLE ID="4">Sis</STYLE> dragged me out through the give-up exit.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Apparently, at a mere 5 meters traveled, it was a record-setting give-up.<PG>
