<STYLE ID="6">"Uh... uh... hnguuuh..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even after we came out of the haunted house, my tears wouldn't stop.<PG>
"Oh, <STYLE ID="4">Momoko</STYLE>! <STYLE ID="6">Erina</STYLE>! How was it?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Dad called out to us in a cheerful voice, without reading the mood at all.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\桃子バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
